 \sourcefile{firmware/verify_f410_hex.py} checks the HEX image addresses against the reserved sector and intended flash regions. \sourcefile{firmware/test_web_protocol.py} tests the production dispatcher with mocked UART, control, and storage behavior. The browser source and tests are included with these files. HEX can preserve the reserved address gap during programming. A flat binary spans that gap; an unchecked binary write or full-chip erase can remove settings. The build script does not flash the board automatically.
 
