-Further powered tests require the fitted parts, sensing gains, and switching timing to be checked, followed by matched electrical and thermal tests toward \SI{100}{\watt}. The reported V2 \SI{85}{\watt} point and approximately \SI{80}{\watt} baseline dataset come from different tests (Section~\ref{sec:hw-v2}).
